province = 70
blurb = "Depicts a high-ranking priest blessing a vessel which is being held aloft by a bowing figure in front of a full moon. The scene is based on a poem by Emperor Sanjō:

Though it is not what is
in my heart,
if in this world of pain
I should linger,
no doubt I shall remember
fondly the bright midnight moon!

Emperor Sanjō only reigned for 5 years until his regent, Fujiwara no Michinaga, forced him to abdicate. By the end of his reign he had grown mostly blind, and died at age 42."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
